@startuml
!include style.iuml
' UC-03 View Exam Dashboard and Start Exam (M3). Built from activity_diagram (start gate), activity_diagnostics
' (check-in, Start enabled at the opening time) and activity_seating (start checks).
' Code: DashboardViewModel (InitializeAsync, ConfirmAttendanceAsync, UpdateStartEligibility, StartExamAsync);
' ExamsController student/current and StartStudentExam: NOT_ELIGIBLE -> EXAM_CLOSED -> EXAM_NOT_STARTED ->
' CheckSeatOnStartAsync (desktop client, SEAT_MISMATCH) -> resume an InProgress session -> already submitted ->
' READINESS_REQUIRED -> new InProgress session.
' Plain labels: endpoints and error codes are left out.
' Large font at dpi 96. Printed pt = fontSize * printed_width_pt / png_width_px.
skinparam dpi 96
skinparam defaultFontSize 24
skinparam ArrowFontSize 24
skinparam ArrowThickness 1.5
skinparam padding 1
skinparam swimlane {
  BorderColor #777777
  TitleFontSize 25
}
!pragma useVerticalIf on

|Student|
|Desktop App|
|Server|
|Student|
start
:Open the exam
dashboard;
|Server|
:Send the exam,
server time and
eligibility, readiness
and seat status;
|Desktop App|
:Show exam details
and countdown;
|Student|
:Press Check In;
|Desktop App|
:Enable Start when the
exam opens, after check-in
and a readiness pass
(if the exam needs it);
|Student|
:Press Start Exam;
|Server|
if (Eligible and
exam open?) then ([no])
  :Refuse with
  the reason;
([yes]) elseif (Desktop app, on
the right seat
if enforced?) then ([no])
  :Refuse; log a
  wrong seat and
  alert live monitor;
([yes]) elseif (Session already
running?) then ([yes])
  :Resume that
  session;
([no]) elseif (Not submitted yet,
readiness passed
if needed?) then ([no])
  :Refuse with
  the reason;
else ([yes])
  :Create a new
  session;
endif
|Desktop App|
if (Session
opened?) then ([yes])
  :Open the locked
  exam window
  (UC-04);
else ([no])
  :Show the
  reason;
endif
stop
@enduml
